Equip and unequip gear at any time. Smart equipment combinations will enhance your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, enemies bring unexpected benefits. Eliminating them too soon may not always be wise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.poster.avif?t=1773289419\" width=520 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.webm?t=1773289419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/161a1527639d4e0579fd98f3da2188f3.mp4?t=1773289419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mission Rewards, Unpredictable Fate&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actively complete missions to earn rewards that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking calculated risks to defy fate might just be the right move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.poster.avif?t=1773289419\" width=520 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.webm?t=1773289419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1420790/extras/605c096b8fdd60efa14ab800cb155d22.mp4?t=1773289419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Resource Depletion, Dynamic Card Pool&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a card’s durability drops to zero, it is permanently removed. Carelessly wasting precious cards is never a smart decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The central area randomly refreshes with monsters and resource cards, ensuring each playthrough presents a fresh strategic challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your attention and support!</p>",
